  m_text: "<size=24>- MEGA SCATTER appears on reel 5 only.\n- 3, 4, or 5 SCATTERS
    with one MEGA symbol triggers 10, 15, or 25 \n  Mega Free Games.\n<style=highlight
    1>- Mega Free Games adds 60 RED MACAW symbols to the reels.\n- MEGA SCATTER appears
    on Reel 5 only during Mega Free Games.\n- MEGA SCATTER during Mega Free Games
    adds 15 RED MACAW to the reels. \n- MEGA SCATTER appears up to 5 times during
    Mega Free Games.</style>\n- 2 or more SCATTERS during Mega Free Games awards more
    Free Games!\n- WILD during Mega Free Games will become 2X or 3X multiplier.</size>"
