  m_text: '<size=24>- 3, 4, or 5 SCATTERS triggers 10, 15, or 25 Free Games respectively.

    - Free Games adds 30 RED MACAW symbols to the reels.

    - 2 or more SCATTERS during Free Games awards more Free Games!

    - WILD during Free Games will become 2X or 3X multiplier.</size>'
